---
// HeroBand.astro - Vercel-inspired hero with atmospheric mesh gradient and dark mode
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-8 pb-6 sm:pt-12 sm:pb-8 hero-mesh-gradient border-b border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] transition-colors duration-200">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Announcement / Mono Eyebrow Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] bg-white/80 dark:bg-[#121212]/80 px-3 py-1 shadow-xs backdrop-blur-sm mb-4">
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono font-medium text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed]">High-Precision Qibla Compass Engine</span>
      <span class="rounded-full bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#888888] dark:text-[#737373]">100% Offline Ready</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Headline -->
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed] leading-[1.1] mb-3">
      Find the exact Qibla direction for prayer.
    </h1>

    <!-- Subtitle -->
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-lg text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] leading-relaxed mb-6 font-normal">
      High-precision web compass with real-time Kaaba angle, geodesic distance, Islamic holidays calendar, and live prayer times.
    </p>

    <!-- Quick Action Bar -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium">
      <button
        id="btn-enable-compass"
        type="button"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#171717] dark:bg-white px-6 py-3 text-white dark:text-[#171717] shadow-md hover:bg-[#2d2d2d] dark:hover:bg-[#e0e0e0] transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer"
      >
        <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-amber-300 dark:text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
        </svg>
        <span id="btn-enable-compass-text">Start Qibla Compass</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
